---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="왁뿌던전 탈출 — 프로젝트 홈"
  description="UE 5.9 Chaos 물리 솔버와 ACharacter를 활용하는 20라운드 왁뿌볼 물리 파괴 액션 디펜스 「왁뿌던전 탈출」 프로젝트 홈"
>
  <div class="wp-hub">
    <nav class="wp-breadcrumb" aria-label="이동 경로">
      <a href="/learn/projects">Projects</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="current">왁뿌던전 탈출</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="wp-hero">
      <div class="wp-hero-copy">
        <div class="wp-pills">
          <span class="wp-pill status">
            <span class="wp-dot"></span>
            PROTOTYPING · UE 5.9
          </span>
          <span class="wp-pill meta">Chaos Solver · ACharacter · MetaSound · 20 Waves</span>
        </div>

        <h1>왁뿌던전 탈출 (WaxPpuLab)</h1>
        <p class="wp-desc">
          언리얼 엔진 내장 <strong>Chaos 물리 솔버</strong>와 <strong>ACharacter</strong>를 적극 활용하는 3D 물리 파괴 웨이브 디펜스입니다.
          플레이어가 가한 힘에 따라 실시간으로 부서지는 왁뿌볼·왁스버터 몬스터를 처치하며 <strong>20라운드와 거대 왁뿌볼 보스</strong>를 돌파해 던전에서 탈출합니다.
        </p>

        <div class="wp-actions">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/pargame/WaxPpuLab"
            class="wp-link-btn primary"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub · WaxPpuLab ↗
          </a>
          <a href="/learn/projects" class="wp-link-btn ghost">
            ← 프로젝트 목록
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a
        href="/learn/projects/waxppu-dungeon/portfolio"
        class="wp-thumb"
        aria-label="왁뿌던전 탈출 포트폴리오 및 기술 개발기 열기"
      >
        <div class="wp-thumb-art">
          <span class="wp-thumb-orb"></span>
          <span class="wp-thumb-label">CHAOS × ACHARACTER</span>
        </div>
        <span class="wp-thumb-cap">UE 5.9 Prototype · Chaos Destruction + Hybrid ASMR</span>
      </a>
    </header>

    <section class="posts-section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">DOCUMENTS IN THIS PROJECT</span>
        <h2>프로젝트 문서</h2>
        <p>게임 기획서(GDD)와 C++ 프로토타입 기술 개발기(포트폴리오)를 문서별로 분리해 관리합니다.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="post-cards">
        <a href="/learn/projects/waxppu-dungeon/gdd" class="post-card gdd-card">
          <div class="post-top">
            <span class="post-type">DOC 01 · 기획서</span>
            <span class="post-arrow">→</span>
          </div>
          <h3>게임 기획서 (GDD)</h3>
          <p>
            Chaos 물리 솔버와 <code>ACharacter</code> 적극 활용이라는 2대 목표, 20라운드 웨이브 및 거대 왁뿌볼 보스 탈출 루프, 주요 구성 요소의 큰 틀을 정리했습니다.
          </p>
          <div class="post-tags">
            <span>#기획서</span>
            <span>#ChaosSolver</span>
            <span>#ACharacter</span>
            <span>#20Waves</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/learn/projects/waxppu-dungeon/portfolio" class="post-card portfolio-card">
          <div class="post-top">
            <span class="post-type">DOC 02 · 포트폴리오 / 기술 개발기</span>
            <span class="post-arrow">→</span>
          </div>
          <h3>포트폴리오 · WaxPpuLab 기술 개발기</h3>
          <p>
            UE 5.9 C++ 프로토타입의 Flat 1-Level + DataAsset 설계, <code>RemoveOnBreak</code> 파편 수명 제어, 버터 양방향 텀블링, Weber-Fechner 하이브리드 ASMR 오디오, Subsurface 왁스 셰이딩 및 M4 16GB 최적화 기록을 담았습니다.
          </p>
          <div class="post-tags">
            <span>#UE5_9</span>
            <span>#ChaosDestruction</span>
            <span>#MetaSound</span>
            <span>#M4_16GB</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .wp-hub {
    --wp-coral: #ff5e9c;
    --wp-peach: #ff9f43;
    --wp-mint: #2ce6b8;
    --wp-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 28%, var(--border));
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .wp-hub {
    --wp-coral: #e12d78;
    --wp-peach: #e07016;
    --wp-mint: #0e9f7d;
  }

  .wp-breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-bottom: -1.6rem;
  }
  .wp-breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .wp-breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--wp-coral);
  }
  .wp-breadcrumb .current {
    color: var(--wp-coral);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .wp-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--wp-border);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 16%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 14%, transparent), transparent 45%),
      var(--surface-1);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
  }
  .wp-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .wp-pill {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .wp-pill.status {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--wp-coral);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 12%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .wp-dot {
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--wp-coral);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--wp-coral);
  }
  .wp-pill.meta {
    color: var(--text-2);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .wp-hero-copy h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 1.4rem + 1.4vw, 2.4rem);
  }
  .wp-desc {
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .wp-desc strong {
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .wp-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .wp-link-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .wp-link-btn.primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--wp-coral), var(--wp-peach));
    border-color: transparent;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .wp-link-btn.primary:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.08);
    color: #ffffff;
    border-color: transparent;
  }
  .wp-link-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--wp-coral);
    color: var(--wp-coral);
  }

  .wp-thumb {
    display: block;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform var(--dur), border-color var(--dur), box-shadow var(--dur);
  }
  .wp-thumb:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--wp-coral);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px -10px color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .wp-thumb-art {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 24%, transparent), transparent 52%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 75% 75%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-peach) 22%, transparent), transparent 52%),
      var(--surface-2);
  }
  .wp-thumb-orb {
    width: 84px;
    height: 84px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 32% 28%, #ffd1e6 0%, #ff5e9c 48%, #ff8a3d 100%);
    box-shadow:
      inset -8px -10px 18px rgba(130, 18, 66, 0.35),
      inset 6px 6px 14px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45),
      0 10px 24px -6px rgba(255, 94, 156, 0.55);
  }
  .wp-thumb-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--wp-coral);
  }
  .wp-thumb-cap {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .section-head {
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--wp-coral);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .section-head h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
  }
  .section-head p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  .post-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.3rem;
  }
  .post-card {
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.7rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .post-card.gdd-card {
    border-top: 3px solid var(--wp-coral);
  }
  .post-card.gdd-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: var(--wp-coral);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px -12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-coral) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .post-card.portfolio-card {
    border-top: 3px solid var(--wp-peach);
  }
  .post-card.portfolio-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: var(--wp-peach);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px -12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--wp-peach) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .post-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .gdd-card .post-type {
    color: var(--wp-coral);
  }
  .portfolio-card .post-type {
    color: var(--wp-peach);
  }
  .post-arrow {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    transition: transform var(--dur-fast), color var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .gdd-card:hover .post-arrow {
    color: var(--wp-coral);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .portfolio-card:hover .post-arrow {
    color: var(--wp-peach);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .post-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .post-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .post-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding-top: 0.4rem;
  }
  .post-tags span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .wp-hero,
    .post-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
